flowchart LR
  OP[Operator and reviewer] -->|Site geometry, schedules, replay and review actions| SW((SentinelWatch))
  SW -->|Status, evidence, reasons, alerts and PDF| OP
  SW -->|AOI, dates and asset reads| SAT[Sentinel-2 provider chain]
  SAT -->|Real catalogue metadata, bands and SCL| SW
  SW -->|Location and date queries| CTX[Rainfall, disaster, OSM and terrain services]
  CTX -->|Optional corroboration or unavailable state| SW
  SW -->|In-app inbox routing| DEPT[Department reviewer]
  DEPT -->|Acknowledgement and outcome| SW
  SW -->|Email only when configured| SMTP[SMTP service]
